If a profile's site is NOT CONFIGURED, site-scoped commands refuse to run. First run
`datus tableau sites list`, present the sites to the user and let them choose; then
pass `--site CONTENT_URL` on each command or save `site_content_url` in the profile
(an empty string means the default site). The user may switch sites at any time
with `--site`.
Metadata and download permissions determine coverage. Inspect the bundle before
using it; incomplete lineage, unsupported calculations, and missing upstream ETL
must remain explicit. Never invent source SQL or silently reuse it as a DOSI query.
